--
^CONVERSION ERROR$
A variadic constructor whose trailing parameter pack is empty in the recursion
base must expand the pack to zero parameters and initialize each subobject,
mirroring the libstdc plus plus _Tuple_impl recursive constructor for a
two-element tuple.  The recursion base TImpl with an empty Tail currently
leaves a spurious void parameter and an unresolved empty-pack base initializer,
so construction fails and even head0 is not initialized.  Flip to CORE once
variadic constructor parameter-pack expansion handles the empty recursion-base
pack.
